  "body": "[MSC3440](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/3440) is currently in a final comment period. We'll need to make a few tweaks to stabilize support for it:\r\n\r\n* [x] Use the proper serialization configuration: #12085\r\n* [x] Support stable identifiers:\r\n\t* `io.element.relation_senders` -> `related_by_senders`\r\n\t* `io.element.relation_types` -> `related_by_rel_types`\r\n\t* `io.element.thread` -> `m.thread`\r\n* [x] Remove experimental configuration flag and unstable identifiers.\r\n\r\nWe'll probably want to overlap support of stable & unstable identifiers for a couple of releases.\r\n\r\nSee also: #11753.",
